  // Disabled when there is no key so products without a size guide skip the Contentful fetch.
  // sizeGuideTableReference Entry links are resolved inline via include=2 by resolveLinkedAssets.
  // include=3 required: sizeGuide → sizeGuideTable → imageFallback (image entry) → asset
